{"4089780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Epic Idlenture", "steam_appid": 4089780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Epic Idlenture is perfect for...</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/6139152a20b114d848a1ec407c47619c.avif?t=1781797503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras_big/6139152a20b114d848a1ec407c47619c.webp?t=1781797503 width=1560 height=606 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the endless Dungeon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your axe and prepare for an endless journey! <strong>Epic Idlenture</strong> is a pixel-art idle dungeon crawler where a relentless bear fights through infinite floors. Lose yourself in the fast-paced automated combat and dive deep into the tactical management. Collect powerful gear, min-max your stats, and grow infinitely stronger to conquer whatever lurks below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/ec5905c8a760e06dacbf8bfc15f71e2c.poster.avif?t=1781797503\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/ec5905c8a760e06dacbf8bfc15f71e2c.webm?t=1781797503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/ec5905c8a760e06dacbf8bfc15f71e2c.mp4?t=1781797503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight your way to the Depths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your bear handles the brawling, your job is to build the ultimate hero. Sort through your drops to forge legendary gear, and push your bear's limits with deep stat progression:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Auto-Combat:</strong> Let your hero handle the slashing while you focus on the big picture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tougher Challenges:</strong> Further down you go, the more dangerous the enemies become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Your Build:</strong> Turn your hard-earned gold into raw power. Tune your bear's attributes to create the ultimate dungeon-clearing machine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/b57a0ead01c90ce67e07b44d0399a147.poster.avif?t=1781797503\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/b57a0ead01c90ce67e07b44d0399a147.webm?t=1781797503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/b57a0ead01c90ce67e07b44d0399a147.mp4?t=1781797503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash devastating Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a simple axe swing isn't enough, it's time to bring out the heavy hitters. Activate powerful abilities and wipe out whole rooms in an instant. Clear the path, overcome the hardest floors, and see how deep your bear can truly go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/7156b7345bea6d7640d2e87114945c51.poster.avif?t=1781797503\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/7156b7345bea6d7640d2e87114945c51.webm?t=1781797503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/7156b7345bea6d7640d2e87114945c51.mp4?t=1781797503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer the Guardians</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every deep run eventually hits a wall, and that wall is usually a giant monster. These massive bosses stand between you and the bottom of the dungeon. Take them down to claim the best gear drops and open the path to even more dangerous floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/35ee47eac176ddb1ac4e001e31e56394.poster.avif?t=1781797503\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/35ee47eac176ddb1ac4e001e31e56394.webm?t=1781797503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/35ee47eac176ddb1ac4e001e31e56394.mp4?t=1781797503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready for an endless Adventure?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Epic Idlenture to your <strong>Wishlist</strong> today so you don't miss the launch!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the endless Dungeon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your axe and prepare for an endless journey! <strong>Epic Idlenture</strong> is a pixel-art idle dungeon crawler where a relentless bear fights through infinite floors. Lose yourself in the fast-paced automated combat and dive deep into the tactical management. Collect powerful gear, min-max your stats, and grow infinitely stronger to conquer whatever lurks below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://share