astating Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a simple axe swing isn't enough, it's time to bring out the heavy hitters. Activate powerful abilities and wipe out whole rooms in an instant. Clear the path, overcome the hardest floors, and see how deep your bear can truly go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/7156b7345bea6d7640d2e87114945c51.poster.avif?t=1781797503\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/7156b7345bea6d7640d2e87114945c51.webm?t=1781797503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/7156b7345bea6d7640d2e87114945c51.mp4?t=1781797503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer the Guardians</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every deep run eventually hits a wall, and that wall is usually a giant monster. These massive bosses stand between you and the bottom of the dungeon. Take them down to claim the best gear drops and open the path to even more dangerous floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/35ee47eac176ddb1ac4e001e31e56394.poster.avif?t=1781797503\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/35ee47eac176ddb1ac4e001e31e56394.webm?t=1781797503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089780/extras/35ee47eac176ddb1ac4e001e31e56394.mp4?t=1781797503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready for an endless Adventure?</str